The package supplies stb_image.h without an implementation archive. Each
consumer owns exactly one STB_IMAGE_IMPLEMENTATION translation unit. Linking
another global implementation alongside an existing one can duplicate symbols;
STB_IMAGE_STATIC is not used to hide that ownership problem. Libultraship can
retain its existing single implementation owner while using this header.

No stdio, image-format, HDR, linear conversion, allocator, TLS or SIMD feature
macros are imposed. No image data or private assets are included.

Original Pyxis recipe and documentation use MPL-2.0. Their complete source is
installed under share/stb/pyxis, with the license alongside this notice.
Upstream code and notices retain their own terms.
